+| Rule | Limit | Reason |
+|------|-------|--------|
+| **Elements per graphic** | 3-5 maximum | More elements = smaller text |
+| **Words per graphic** | 10-15 maximum | Minimal text = larger fonts |
+| **Flowchart steps** | 4-5 maximum | Keeps labels readable |
